# Base surface color

When building any new creation surface — tables, panels, cards, editors,
overlays, etc. — use the same base background color that documents use:

```
#151515
```

## Rules

- Default base/fill for new surfaces = `#151515` (match the documents surface).
- Keep this consistent so new UI reads as part of the same document system.
- Only deviate when the user explicitly asks for a different color.
